                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Members who supply milk to the cooperative society are paid ₹3.00 per litre for the prescribed standard (7.50% to 7.99% fat-free solids) and ₹4.00 per litre for 8.00% or higher fat-free solids. "
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The incentive is credited to the milk society members through Direct Benefit Transfer (DBT) into their bank accounts. For this purpose, milk suppliers must provide their bank account details to the cooperative society."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            }
          ],
          "type": "align_justify"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": ""
            }
          ],
          "type": "paragraph"
        }
      ],
      "process_md": "\n  - Members who supply milk to the cooperative society are paid ₹3.00 per litre for the prescribed standard (7.50% to 7.99% fat-free solids) and ₹4.00 per litre for 8.00% or higher fat-free solids. \n  - The incentive is credited to the milk society members through Direct Benefit Transfer (DBT) into their bank accounts. For this purpose, milk suppliers must provide their bank account details to the cooperative society.\n\n<br>\n\n"
    }
  ],
  "benefit_type": {
