    "label": "Cash",
    "value": "cash"
  },
  "benefits": "Under this scheme, in addition to paying the price of milk to cattle farmers who supply milk to milk cooperative societies, an incentive of ₹4.00 per litre or ₹3.00 per litre is also paid, as per the prescribed standards.\n<br>\n\n",
  "brief_description": null,
